<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62616" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκᾰθ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be white</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.27
			</span></i> (codd. opt.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLeid.X.</u>
				84
			</span></i>, <u>Gloss.</u>; of spots on the body, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				13.38
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίχες] λευκαθίζουσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					22.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἶγες χιόνι λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					45.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				17.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. οἱ λόφοι</span>, of snow-clad
			hills, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκία λ. γύψῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epict.
					<u>Gnom.</u>
					43
				</span></i>
			; of fluids in the eye, <i>to be colourless</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cass.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				27
			</span></i>; of eyes, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.44
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λελευκαθισμένη</span>
			<i>clad in white</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ca.</u>
				8.5
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκανθ</span>- is read in <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
			</span></i>, but is against the metre, also in <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epict.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cass.
			</span></i>, and <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
			</span></i>, and is v.l. in Hdt.l.c., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ca.</u>
			</span></i>l.c.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκαθέω,
			ὑπολευκαθίζω</span>.)</div>
